Root cause:
The bug was caused by the resetting of `test_case->success` to `test->success` after each parameterized test run, which led to the overall success status being incorrectly overwritten by non-failing results, thus failing to propagate the failure of any individual parameterized test to the overall test suite result.

Code statements information:
